   PEC3202CS ~ PEC3205CS Series
    ESD Protection
                                                              SOD-323
     Voltage        2.5~5 V

     Features
     IEC61000-4-2(ESD): ± 15 kV Air, ± 8 kV Contact
      Compliance with the capability up to ± 30 kV
     IEC61000-4-5(Lightning) : 5~10A(8/20uS)
     Lead free in compliance with EU RoHS 2.0
     Green molding compound as per IEC 61249 standard




     Mechanical Data
     Case : SOD-323 Package
     Terminals : Solderable per MIL-STD-750, Method 2026
     Approx. Weight : 0.0041 grams




